1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,668
After finding out the truth

2
00:00:01,668 --> 00:00:03,148
I began to see things
I missed before.

3
00:00:03,737 --> 00:00:04,738
No, I'm right.

4
00:00:04,738 --> 00:00:05,739
If I could just...

5
00:00:06,873 --> 00:00:07,874
Hey!

6
00:00:07,874 --> 00:00:08,875
Are you two dating?

7
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:09,743
Excuse me?

8
00:00:09,743 --> 00:00:10,877
What are you talking about?

9
00:00:10,877 --> 00:00:12,145
We're just co-workers.

10
00:00:12,145 --> 00:00:13,956
Just because a young man
and a woman are together

11
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,849
doesn't mean that
you can accuse us that way.

12
00:00:15,982 --> 00:00:18,618
I'll only make a fool
out of myself.

13
00:00:18,618 --> 00:00:19,686
So for now, I'll stay low.

14
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,922
Until I catch them
in the act...

15
00:00:29,863 --> 00:00:30,863
What's with the photo?

16
00:00:31,297 --> 00:00:33,366
I thought if I left pictures

17
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,934
it'll be easier for
the customers

18
00:00:34,934 --> 00:00:37,037
to pick the flowers.

19
00:00:38,004 --> 00:00:39,406
Oh.

20
00:00:39,839 --> 00:00:41,074
That's a wonderful idea!

21
00:00:46,413 --> 00:00:47,480
Why are you so late?

22
00:00:48,915 --> 00:00:50,350
My shift starts at 2 o'clock.

23
00:00:52,052 --> 00:00:53,119
I'm not late.

24
00:00:54,154 --> 00:00:55,321
Go and prepare
for your shift.

25
00:01:06,566 --> 00:01:07,400
Excuse me.

26
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,035
Yes, sir, on my way.
